// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
go 1.26.0

// Require at least this patch toolchain to build: it carries the standard
// library's security fixes (html/template, net/http, net/textproto,
// crypto/tls - GO-2026-6599 to -6611; crypto/x509 - GO-2026-6809). Go
// 1.25 is out of support and got none of them, so the floor is a 1.26
// patch. The Docker builders use the floating golang:1.26 tag, which
// tracks the latest patch - so images pick up a new patch on their own,
// and this pin is what CI's vulnerability scan runs with: keep it there.
toolchain go1.26.10

use (
	.
	./plugins
)
